The [[Health Potion]] is a rare [[Potion]] available in the shop for all characters. It heals a small amount and cleanses some {{icon/poison}}. While the [[Health Potion]] itself isn't particularly powerful except in the early-game, it can get the player started in a [[Potion]] build, where, with certain synergies, it can become more useful. A [[Healing Herbs]] can craft the [[Health Potion]] into the much stronger [[Strong Health Potion]], and a [[Blueberries]] can craft it into a [[Mana Potion]]. The [[Health Potion]] can also craft with the [[Shiny Shell]] into [[Shelly]], a strong [[Potion]] synergy item which will usually heal much more than a [[Health Potion]] unless the opponent kills the player very quickly.

Like all [[Potion]]s, when used, it will apply the affect of the [[Potion]] above it, without consuming the one above. This adjacency is unlike most in that the {{icon/star}} will always be placed above the [[Potion]], rather than rotating along with the item.
